# --- Local credentials, dumps & recordings (never commit) ---
# Unanchored: they are ignored in every folder. Recordings of classrooms are minors' data. If a test ever
# needs a small synthetic media fixture, add an explicit `!path/to/fixture.wav` exception.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.dump
*.age
*.sql.gz
*.mp3
*.mpeg
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.wav
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.webm
*.flac
*.aac
*.3gp
*.mov
*.mkv

